# The actor wrapper (design/actors.md), a std/go worker. One program, two
# positions like run-and-update-ref: start reads the branch head and tail-calls
# the inner request; finish publishes the new state by moving the branch with a
# compare-and-swap. std/go has git, which start uses to read the head.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go
